WEBVTT

00:00:56.886 --> 00:01:00.848
Now let’s take a look at maps
that show which countries were featured

00:01:00.848 --> 00:01:05.478
in three major global investigations
from 2016 to 2021.

00:01:06.312 --> 00:01:09.398
So this is “Panama Papers,”

00:01:09.398 --> 00:01:12.193
“Paradise Papers,”

00:01:12.193 --> 00:01:13.194
“Pandora Papers.”

00:01:14.529 --> 00:01:19.158
As you can see, some countries
keep being blank spots on these maps,

00:01:19.158 --> 00:01:21.244
and one of them is Kyrgyzstan,

00:01:21.244 --> 00:01:22.453
my home country.

00:01:23.371 --> 00:01:26.666
And does it mean there is no
organized crime in Kyrgyzstan

00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:28.126
or maybe no corruption?

00:01:29.001 --> 00:01:30.002
No way.